          "description": "Origin: PAQUID study group, Inserm and University of Bordeaux, Dartigues JF et al. (1992). The Paquid epidemiological program on brain ageing. Neuroepidemiology 11 (Suppl 1): 14-18. Taken from the BioBench R package (dataset paquid), which took them from riskRegression::Paquid, first released in the timeROC package.",
